- [吸气，呼气]

01:07.500 --> 01:09.933
[door opens]
- Rev your excitement engines,
[门打开]
- Rev your excitement engines,

01:09.933 --> 01:11.567
Mr. Squidward.
[grunts]
章鱼哥先生。
[咕哝]

01:11.567 --> 01:13.733
Do ye not know
what tomorrow is?
你不知道吗
明天是什么？

01:13.733 --> 01:16.433
