慢动作
走向空旷的地平线？

01:19.067 --> 01:23.467
- No, that's today.
Tomorrow is Food Con!
- 不，就是今天。
明天就是美食节啦！

01:23.467 --> 01:25.433
- Whoa! Food Con!
- 哇！食品骗局！

01:25.433 --> 01:27.500
Wait, what's a Food Con?
等等，什么是美食节？

01:27.500 --> 01:29.067
- Additionally,
who cares?
- 另外，
谁在乎呢？

01:29.067 --> 01:32.600
- Mr. Squidward, Food Con is
the biggest convention
- Mr. Squidward, Food Con is
最大的会议

01:32.600 --> 01:34.933
of food fans
in the entire ocean.
美食迷的
在整个海洋中。

01:34.933 --> 01:37.733
The best chefs and cooks
gather together and compete
最好的厨师和厨师
gather together and compete

01:37.733 --> 01:42.667
for the top prize,
the golden cornucopia!
为了获得最高奖项，
金色的聚宝盆！

01:42.667 --> 01:44.667
- Oh boy!
The Krabby Patty is
- 天啊！
蟹肉饼是

01:44.667 --> 01:46.733
a sure bet to win
the golden corn-ocobbia!
必胜的赌注
金色的玉米棒子！

01:46.733 --> 01:48.333
- You're darn tootin'
it is!
- 你真是太TMD了
是的！

01:48.333 --> 01:50.667
And you two will be
me right-claw men!
你们两个将会
我右爪人！

01:50.667 --> 01:52.500
Eh, I could use some
extra muscle, though,
呃，我可以用一些
不过，额外的肌肉

01:52.500 --> 01:53.933
to help set up the booth.
帮助搭建展位。

01:53.933 --> 01:56.100
Hmm.
- [grunting]
唔。
- [咕哝]

01:56.100 --> 01:58.233
[strains, grunts]
[紧张、咕哝声]

01:58.233 --> 02:00.100
[chews]
[咀嚼]

02:00.100 --> 02:01.267
- Perfect.
- 完美的。

02:01.267 --> 02:02.833
Let's hit the road!
我们上路吧！

02:02.833 --> 02:04.667
[bubbles pop]
[气泡破裂]

02:04.667 --> 02:08.533
As you can see gentlemen,
I have spared no expense
As you can see gentlemen,
我不遗余力

02:08.533 --> 02:10.300
on our
transportation.
在我们的
交通。

02:10.300 --> 02:12.300
[all exclaim]
[所有人惊呼]

02:12.300 --> 02:13.533
[tires screech]
[轮胎尖叫声]

02:13.533 --> 02:14.700
- Tada!
- 田田！

02:14.700 --> 02:16.200
- Whoo!
- Oh, what a ride!
- 呼！
- 噢，多么美妙的旅程啊！

02:16.200 --> 02:17.500
