- 哦。

02:17.500 --> 02:19.967
- And I brought plenty
of free samples to sell.
- 我带了很多
免费样品出售。

02:19.967 --> 02:22.867
- This is the best day ever!
- 这是有史以来最好的一天！

02:22.867 --> 02:25.467
both: Road trip!
[electric guitars wail]
两人：公路旅行！
[电吉他哀嚎]

02:25.467 --> 02:27.333
[punches]
[coughs]
[拳头]
[咳嗽]

02:27.333 --> 02:29.467
- Mm.
- 毫米。

02:29.467 --> 02:30.667
[bubbles pop]
[气泡破裂]

02:30.667 --> 02:34.367
[laughter]
[笑声]

02:34.367 --> 02:37.933
- I spy with my little eye--
- Mr. Krabs!
-我用我的小眼睛监视--
- 蟹老板！

02:37.933 --> 02:39.600
- Yes!
- [giggles]
- 是的！
- [咯咯笑]

02:39.600 --> 02:43.433
I spy with my little eye--
- Mr. Krabs!
我用我的小眼睛窥探——
- 蟹老板！

02:43.433 --> 02:47.633
- Oh ho! Yes, yes!
- I spy with my little eye--
- 哦嗬！是的，是的！
-我用我的小眼睛监视--

02:47.633 --> 02:49.900
- Mr. Krabs?
- Oh! How did you know?
- 蟹老板？
- 哦！你怎么知道的？

02:49.900 --> 02:51.167
- Enough!
- 足够的！

02:51.167 --> 02:53.867
Ye both are barnacles
on me brain!
你们都是藤壶
在我的脑子里！

02:53.867 --> 02:55.667
both: Whoa look at that!
两人：哇看看那个！

02:55.667 --> 02:57.167
- The World's
Second Biggest Lump
- 世界的
第二大肿块

02:57.167 --> 02:59.767
is only 50 miles away,
we gotta see it!
距离仅50英里，
我们一定要看看！

02:59.767 --> 03:01.067
both: No.
两人：没有。

03:01.067 --> 03:03.167
- The World's Least
Exciting Sweater!
- 世界上最少的
令人兴奋的毛衣！

03:03.167 --> 03:06.733
My parents fell in love there!
We gotta go!
My parents fell in love there!
我们得走了！

03:06.733 --> 03:08.367
both: Cool toilet!
[flushing]
两人：厕所真酷！
[冲水]

03:08.367 --> 03:10.533
both: No.
- We are not stopping
两人：没有。
- 我们不会停止

03:10.533 --> 03:12.500
till we get to Food Con!
直到我们到达美食展！

03:12.500 --> 03:14.567
[bubbles pop]
[气泡破裂]

03:14.567 --> 03:17.567
- Hey!
- 嘿！

03:17.567 --> 03:19.200
[horn blares]
[screams]
[喇叭声]
[尖叫声]

03:19.200 --> 03:20.933
- Hey!
- 嘿！

03:20.933 --> 03:22.467
[moans, snores]
[truck horn honks]
[呻吟声、打鼾声]
[卡车喇叭鸣响]

03:22.467 --> 03:23.667
[babbling, growls]
[胡言乱语，咆哮]

03:23.667 --> 03:25.100
For the last time,
we get it!
最后一次，
我们明白了！

03:25.100 --> 03:26.500
Trucks have horns!
卡车有喇叭！

03:26.500 --> 03:28.367
- Come on Squidward.
Give it a try!
- 来吧，章鱼哥。
尝试一下！

03:28.367 --> 03:30.267
If I do,
will you promise to stop?
如果我这样做，
你会答应停下来吗？

03:30.267 --> 03:31.567
both: Yes!
两人：是的！

03:31.567 --> 03:36.900
- All right.
Hey!
- 好的。
嘿！

03:36.900 --> 03:38.833
[machinery moving,
