[机械移动，
液体气泡]

03:38.833 --> 03:40.600
[horn honks]
[喇叭鸣响]

03:40.600 --> 03:43.300
Typical.
- You did it wrong, Squidward.
典型的。
- 你做错了，章鱼哥。

03:43.300 --> 03:45.233
- I did it exactly
the way you did it!
- 我确实做到了
你就是这么做的！

03:45.233 --> 03:46.933
- Everybody pipe down!
- 大家都安静下来！

03:46.933 --> 03:50.167
I don't want to hear
another peep from anyone
我不想听
任何人的另一次窥视

03:50.167 --> 03:53.133
until we get
to Food Con!
直到我们得到
去美食节！

03:53.133 --> 03:54.433
- Peep.
- Not a peep!
- 窥视。
- 没有偷看！

03:54.433 --> 03:56.233
- Peep!
- Not. A. Peep!
- 窥视！
- 不是。答：窥视！

03:56.233 --> 03:57.267
- Peep!
- 窥视！

03:57.267 --> 03:59.233
all: Peep's Cliff!
所有人：窥视悬崖！

03:59.233 --> 04:00.633
[screaming]
[尖叫]

04:00.633 --> 04:04.100
[splashing]
[screaming]
[溅]
[尖叫]

04:04.100 --> 04:06.067
[splashing]
[溅]

04:06.067 --> 04:09.367
[yelling]
[大喊]

04:12.300 --> 04:14.533
[screaming]
[尖叫]

04:14.533 --> 04:16.133
[crashing]
