to the pain he inflicts.
谁的欲望蒙蔽了他
他所造成的痛苦。

05:17.867 --> 05:20.300
In short, this whole trip
is beginning to look
总之这整个行程
正在开始寻找

05:20.300 --> 05:21.833
like a whoopsie!
像百日咳一样！

05:21.833 --> 05:23.533
- [wobbling, straining]
Ay.
- [摇晃，紧张]
哎呀。

05:23.533 --> 05:26.333
Patrick, are you okay?
[yells, farts]
帕特里克，你还好吗？
[喊叫、放屁]

05:26.333 --> 05:29.333
- 100%.
[stretching]
- 100%。
[伸展]

05:29.333 --> 05:32.067
[pops]
Uh.
[流行音乐]
呃。

05:32.067 --> 05:34.367
- Mr. Krabs, we've got to
stop for the night
- 蟹老板，我们必须这么做
停下来过夜

05:34.367 --> 05:36.833
if you want Spongebob
and Patrick to live.
如果你想要海绵宝宝
和帕特里克一起生活。

05:36.833 --> 05:38.433
I'm not saying
that's what I want,
我不是说
这就是我想要的，

05:38.433 --> 05:39.933
I'm just telling you
the facts.
我只是告诉你
事实。

05:39.933 --> 05:40.967
[bubbles pop]
[气泡破裂]

05:40.967 --> 05:44.200
[spooky music]
[owl hoots]
[诡异的音乐]
[猫头鹰叫声]

05:44.200 --> 05:46.567
[forest noises]
[森林噪音]

05:46.567 --> 05:47.833
[shivering, whimpering]
[颤抖，呜咽]

05:47.833 --> 05:49.967
[howling]
[startled noises]
[嚎叫]
[惊恐的声音]

05:49.967 --> 05:51.700
- We must guard
this last patty
- 我们必须守护
最后这个小馅饼

05:51.700 --> 05:52.933
with our very lives.
和我们的生命。

05:52.933 --> 05:54.933
It's the only way
to win Food Con,
这是唯一的方法
赢得食品展，

05:54.933 --> 05:56.600
and who knows what
scary, hungry things
谁知道是什么
可怕的、饥饿的东西

05:56.600 --> 05:58.900
are out there in the woods,
waiting to gobble it up!
在树林里，
等着把它吞掉！

05:58.900 --> 06:00.400
[growling]
[咆哮]

06:00.400 --> 06:01.800
Positions, everyone.
大家各就各位。

06:01.800 --> 06:03.333
[claws snapping, growling]
[爪子折断，咆哮]

06:03.333 --> 06:06.133
[startled noises]
[growling]
[惊恐的声音]
[咆哮]

06:06.133 --> 06:09.233
[all whimper]
[全都呜咽]

06:09.233 --> 06:10.867
[meowing]
[喵喵叫]

06:10.867 --> 06:14.700
- Aw, hey little fella.
- 噢，嘿小家伙。

06:14.700 --> 06:18.967
[dramatic music]
[snarling]
[戏剧音乐]
[咆哮]

06:18.967 --> 06:21.100
[growls]
[咆哮]

06:21.100 --> 06:22.333
[all scream]
[所有人尖叫]

06:22.333 --> 06:24.333
[snarls]
[咆哮]

06:24.333 --> 06:26.200
all: The patty!
全体：肉饼！

06:27.733 --> 06:29.933
[panting]
- Oh, what are we gonna do!
[气喘吁吁]
- 哦，我们该怎么办！

06:29.933 --> 06:32.600
- Don't eat my patty!
- 别吃我的肉饼！

06:32.600 --> 06:35.467
[grunts] Yah!
- [screams]
[咕哝] 啊！
- [尖叫]

06:35.467 --> 06:36.533
Whoa! [yells]
哇！ [喊叫]

06:36.533 --> 06:38.233
[inhales, munches]
[吸气，咀嚼]

06:38.233 --> 06:40.400
[spits, groans]
[吐口水，呻吟]

06:40.400 --> 06:41.800
[screaming, thud]
- Oh!
[尖叫声、重击声]
- 哦！

06:41.800 --> 06:44.700
- Squidward!
You saved the Krabby Patty!
- 章鱼哥！
你拯救了蟹黄饼！

06:44.700 --> 06:46.733
- Whoopee.
[bubbles pop]
- 哎哟。
[气泡破裂]

06:46.733 --> 06:48.800
[stomach rumbles]
[肚子咕咕叫]

06:48.800 --> 06:51.400
[moans]
[呻吟声]

06:51.400 --> 06:52.400
- Mm.
[door creaks]
- 毫米。
[门吱吱作响]

06:52.400 --> 06:53.433
[fluttering]
[飘动]

06:53.433 --> 06:54.833
[angelic glowing]
[天使般的光芒]

06:54.833 --> 06:57.600
Maybe I could just
eat a pickle.
也许我可以
吃一个泡菜。

06:57.600 --> 07:00.867
- Maybe I could just eat
the corner of the lettuce.
-也许我可以吃点东西
生菜的一角。

07:00.867 --> 07:03.067
- I don't want to be a hog.
- 我不想成为一头猪。

07:03.067 --> 07:05.700
I'll just eat
what's left over.
我就吃个饭
剩下什么。

07:05.700 --> 07:07.200
- No!
We can't do that!
- 不！
我们不能那样做！

07:07.200 --> 07:09.867
I know we're all hungry,
but we must stay focused.
我知道我们都饿了
但我们必须保持专注。

07:09.867 --> 07:13.767
Remember Food Con!
Remember the cornucopia!
记住美食节！
记住聚宝盆！

07:13.767 --> 07:19.200
- He says Food Con,
but all I hear is food.
- 他说食品展，
但我听到的都是食物。

07:19.200 --> 07:21.433
[bubbles pop]
[气泡破裂]

07:21.433 --> 07:23.067
[fire burns out]
[火熄灭了]

07:23.067 --> 07:25.800
- Hey, SpongeBob,
you look tired.
- 嘿，海绵宝宝，
你看起来很累。

07:25.800 --> 07:28.133
You want me to guard
the patty for a bit?
你要我守护
吃一点肉饼？

07:28.133 --> 07:30.800
- [yawns] Thanks, Patrick.
That'd be great.
- [哈欠] 谢谢，帕特里克。
那太好了。

07:30.800 --> 07:33.200
- [laughs]
- [snores]
- [笑]
- [打鼾]

07:33.200 --> 07:34.400
[glass shattering]
[玻璃破碎]

07:34.400 --> 07:35.900
- Ah--
- Patrick, no!
- 啊--
- 帕特里克，不！

07:35.900 --> 07:38.700
- I can't believe
you thought I would eat it.
- 我不敢相信
你以为我会吃它。

07:38.700 --> 07:40.767
- Patrick I'm sorry
I doubted you.
- 帕特里克，对不起
我怀疑你。

07:40.767 --> 07:42.933
I'm just hungry and tired
and I feel like
我只是又饿又累
我觉得

07:42.933 --> 07:44.267
I'm all alone
doing the right thing
我独自一人
做正确的事

07:44.267 --> 07:46.067
and I want that-
[growling, slobbering]
我想要那个-
[咆哮，流口水]

07:46.067 --> 07:48.433
Hey! Hey!
- But I'm hungry!
嘿！嘿！
- 但我饿了！

07:48.433 --> 07:51.133
- Yah!
- Oh! [laughs]
- 啊！
- 哦！ [笑]

07:51.133 --> 07:52.500
[bubbles pop]
[气泡破裂]

07:52.500 --> 07:55.767
- I'll lull him to sleep
with a lovely lullaby.
- 我会哄他入睡
伴随着一首可爱的摇篮曲。

07:55.767 --> 07:57.500
- Ooh, good idea.
- 哦，好主意。

07:57.500 --> 08:00.633
Music soothes
the savage beast.
音乐舒缓
野蛮的野兽。

08:00.633 --> 08:02.600
[plays clarinet]
What the!
[演奏单簧管]
什么啊！

08:02.600 --> 08:03.867
[screaming]
[尖叫]

08:03.867 --> 08:07.267
- Did I say soothes?
I guess I meant enrages.
- 我有说安抚吗？
我想我的意思是愤怒。

08:07.267 --> 08:10.733
[screams]
[尖叫声]

08:10.733 --> 08:11.733
[thud]
[babbles]
[砰]
[胡言乱语]

08:11.733 --> 08:13.067
[honks, snaps]
[喇叭声、啪啪声]

08:13.067 --> 08:14.867
- Everybody's a critic.
- 每个人都是批评家。

08:14.867 --> 08:17.733
[bubbles pop]
[气泡破裂]

08:17.733 --> 08:19.367
- Hey there, boyo.
- [screams]
- 嘿，小伙子。
- [尖叫]

08:19.367 --> 08:21.667
- I've taken the liberty
of creating a safe
- 我已经冒昧了
创造一个安全的

08:21.667 --> 08:24.333
to secure
our precious patty.
确保
我们珍贵的肉饼。

08:24.333 --> 08:26.067
- Great idea, Mr. Krabs!
- 好主意，蟹老板！

08:26.067 --> 08:28.067
- Just put it
right in here.
- 就放吧
就在这里。

08:28.067 --> 08:31.633
I'll even step away
while you do it.
我什至会走开
当你这样做的时候。

08:31.633 --> 08:33.133
Ahh.
啊。

08:34.767 --> 08:36.367
- Pew, smells really bad
in there.
- 皮尤，气味很难闻
在那里。

08:36.367 --> 08:38.400
- Okay, just do it already!
- [gasps]
- 好吧，就这么做吧！
- [喘气]

08:38.400 --> 08:40.633
No!
- Enough of this.
不！
- 够了。

08:40.633 --> 08:41.867
I am your boss,
我是你的老板，

08:41.867 --> 08:44.100
and I order you
to give me that patty!
我命令你
把那个肉饼给我！

08:44.100 --> 08:46.300
- No, Mr. Krabs,
I will not.
- 不，蟹老板先生，
我不会。

08:46.300 --> 08:47.867
But I will give you these.
但我会给你这些。

08:47.867 --> 08:49.667
[bell dings]
Nature patties!
[铃声]
天然肉饼！

08:49.667 --> 08:51.367
- Oh, boy!
- Oh, delightful!
- 哦，孩子！
- 哦，令人愉快！

08:51.367 --> 08:52.433
- Dig in, boys!
- 挖吧，孩子们！

08:52.433 --> 08:53.500
[all munch]
[全部咀嚼]

08:53.500 --> 08:56.100
[chewing, struggling]
[咀嚼，挣扎]

08:56.100 --> 08:59.767
- Oh, it's like eating the
inside of a lawn mower.
- 哦，就像吃
割草机内部。

08:59.767 --> 09:02.833
- I think mine
is mostly stones.
- 我想我的
大部分是石头。

09:02.833 --> 09:05.800
- Out here we call them
forest tomatoes.
- 在这里我们称他们为
森林西红柿。

09:05.800 --> 09:08.367
[both spit]
[两人都吐了]

09:08.367 --> 09:12.067
[chews, moans]
[gulps]
[咀嚼，呻吟]
[吞咽]

09:12.067 --> 09:14.667
- Enough of this!
- Mr. Krabs, remember Food Con!
- 够了！
- 蟹老板，记住美食节！

09:14.667 --> 09:18.700
- You can't win Food Con
if you've starved to death!
- 你不可能赢得美食大赛
如果你已经饿死了！

09:18.700 --> 09:21.733
Now, give me
that Krabby Patty, boyo.
现在，给我
那个蟹蟹帕蒂，男孩。

09:21.733 --> 09:23.800
- No! I'm doing this
for your own good.
- 不！我正在做这个
为了你好。

09:23.800 --> 09:25.933
I'm protecting you all
from yourselves!
我保护你们所有人
来自你们自己！

09:25.933 --> 09:29.633
- Well, in that case,
you leave me no choice.
- 那么，在这种情况下，
你让我别无选择。

09:29.633 --> 09:30.767
Get him!
抓住他！

09:30.767 --> 09:33.500
[screams]
[all yelling]
[尖叫声]
[大家大喊]

09:33.500 --> 09:35.467
[panicked noises]
[惊慌的声音]

09:35.467 --> 09:37.400
- Whoa!
[grunts]
- 哇！
[咕哝]

09:37.400 --> 09:40.333
[yelling]
[大喊]

09:40.333 --> 09:43.067
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

09:43.867 --> 09:45.600
[stomach rumbles]
[肚子咕咕叫]

09:45.600 --> 09:48.100
- Hey, psst.
It's me, the Patty.
- 嘿，嘘。
是我，帕蒂。

09:48.100 --> 09:49.400
- Oh, hi.
- 哦，嗨。

09:49.400 --> 09:51.067
- It's just me and you
out here now.
- 只有我和你
现在就在这儿。

09:51.067 --> 09:53.400
So, just do it.
Eat me.
所以，就这么做吧。
吃我吧

09:53.400 --> 09:54.667
- What about Food Con?
- 食品展怎么样？

09:54.667 --> 09:56.067
- Oh, forget Food Con.
- 哦，忘了美食节吧。

09:56.067 --> 09:58.067
You're starving,
and I'm right here.
你快饿死了，
我就在这里。

09:58.067 --> 10:00.033
[slurps]
- Maybe you're right.
[啜饮]
- 也许你是对的。

10:00.033 --> 10:02.633
- Of course I'm right,
I'm a talking sandwich.
- 我当然是对的
我是一个会说话的三明治。

10:02.633 --> 10:05.667
- Yes, a sandwich has
no reason to lie.
- 是的，三明治有
没有理由撒谎。

10:05.667 --> 10:11.400
Ahh.
[dramatic music]
啊。
[戏剧音乐]

10:11.400 --> 10:13.700
[gasps] No!
I made a vow.
[喘气]不！
我发誓。

10:13.700 --> 10:15.167
I will not eat you.
我不会吃你的。

10:15.167 --> 10:17.100
- Shh, shh, I can hear him
over there.
- 嘘，嘘，我能听到他的声音
在那儿。

10:17.100 --> 10:18.700
He's arguing
with the patty.
他在争论
和肉饼。

10:18.700 --> 10:20.433
Let's get him! [grunts]
- [moans]
我们来抓住他吧！ [咕哝]
- [呻吟]

10:20.433 --> 10:21.567
[grunting, thud]
[咕噜声，重击声]

10:21.567 --> 10:22.833
- Oh!
[thud, farts]
- 哦！
[咚咚，放屁]

10:22.833 --> 10:24.833
- [hums]
- Don't let him get away!
- [哼哼]
- 别让他跑了！

10:24.833 --> 10:25.867
- Hungry!
- 饥饿的！

10:25.867 --> 10:28.633
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

10:28.633 --> 10:30.733
[yells, whimpers]
[喊叫，呜咽]

10:30.733 --> 10:32.800
Food Con!
食品骗局！

10:32.800 --> 10:35.267
[crowd chattering]
[人群议论]

10:35.267 --> 10:37.800
- I'm filled with meat.
I love being filled with meat.
- 我已经吃饱了
我喜欢充满肉的感觉。

10:37.800 --> 10:39.900
- Ahh
- Get him!
- 啊啊
- 抓住他！

10:39.900 --> 10:41.333
- Guys, we're here!
- 伙计们，我们来了！

10:41.333 --> 10:42.867
- Hungry, hungry, hungry!
- 饿了，饿了，饿了！

10:42.867 --> 10:44.900
- You don't have to
eat the patty.
- 你不必
吃肉饼。

10:44.900 --> 10:46.800
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

10:46.800 --> 10:49.133
[thudding]
- And I hereby award
[重击]
- 我特此授予

10:49.133 --> 10:51.267
the golden
cornucopia to--
金色的
聚宝盆到——

10:51.267 --> 10:53.033
[straining, yells]
[用力，大喊]

10:53.033 --> 10:56.100
- Please, try a delicious
Krabby Patty!
- 请尝尝美味
蟹蟹帕蒂！

10:56.100 --> 10:59.000
- What's this?
A late entry?
- 这是什么？
迟到了？

10:59.000 --> 11:00.300
Hmm.
唔。

11:00.300 --> 11:01.433
[bell dings]
[铃声]

11:01.433 --> 11:07.300
- [in slow motion]
Nature patty!
- [慢动作]
自然肉饼！

11:07.300 --> 11:11.900
- [slow-motion]
Mmm, Krabby Patty.
- [慢动作]
嗯，克拉比帕蒂。

11:11.900 --> 11:14.633
Ahh, um!
[chews]
啊，嗯！
[咀嚼]

11:14.633 --> 11:16.900
[whimpers, gasps]
[呜咽，喘息]

11:16.900 --> 11:19.100
[munches, chewing]
[咀嚼，咀嚼]

11:19.100 --> 11:22.333
- Mmm, this is
the most complex,
- 嗯，这是
最复杂的，

11:22.333 --> 11:26.100
mmm, organic,
mmm, irresistible flavor
嗯，有机的，
嗯嗯，难以抗拒的味道

11:26.100 --> 11:28.500
I have ever had
the pleasure of tasting!
我曾经有过
品尝的乐趣！

11:28.500 --> 11:30.333
[munches]
- Ohh--
[咀嚼]
- 噢--

11:30.333 --> 11:31.567
The winner is...
获胜者是...

11:31.567 --> 11:33.267
Mmm, the Krabby Patty!
嗯，蟹肉饼！

11:33.267 --> 11:35.667
- Oh, excuse me, sir,
that's not the real Krabby--
- 哦，对不起，先生，
那不是真正的蟹蟹——

11:35.667 --> 11:37.767
- Quit your truthing, boy.
- 别说实话了，孩子。

11:37.767 --> 11:40.167
We won.
[cheers and applause]
我们赢了。
[欢呼和掌声]

11:40.167 --> 11:43.067
- The Krabby Patty won!
It won!
- 蟹黄饼赢了！
它赢了！

11:43.067 --> 11:44.167
- Yes.
[munches]
- 是的。
[咀嚼]

11:44.167 --> 11:47.633
[machinery moving,
horn honks]
[机械移动，
喇叭鸣响]

11:47.633 --> 11:49.100
Oh.
哦。

哦。